    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and burnout, metaphorically describing themselves as a cog in a machine being consumed by a system. The user eventually alludes to \"breaking the circuit\" to escape this cycle. The assistant responds by attempting to provide coping mechanisms and suggesting small ways to reclaim autonomy within the existing system.",
